\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFact Sheets\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link is-current\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Releases\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tReleases\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/remarks/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Remarks\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRemarks\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/research/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Research\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tResearch\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</nav>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p><strong>From the largest tax cut for working families in American history to the most secure border on record, Nevada is winning again under President Donald J. Trump and Republican leadership. </strong>Since returning to office, President Trump has cut taxes, driven down crime, secured the border, opened federal lands, unleashed American energy, and attracted billions in private investment to Nevada.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-historic-tax-relief-for-working-families-and-seniors\"><strong>Historic Tax Relief for Working Families and Seniors</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>No Tax on Tips:</strong> More than 440,000 Nevada tipped workers — including those in Las Vegas, the <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/04/in-nevada-president-trump-celebrates-no-tax-on-tips-real-money-to-working-americans/'\">birthplace</a> of this landmark policy — saved an average of $10,000 this filing season.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>No Tax on Overtime:</strong> 150,000 Nevada workers saved an average of $3,000.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>No Tax on Social Security:</strong> 500,000 Nevada seniors paid zero federal taxes on their benefits.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Bigger Refunds:</strong> Nevada’s average tax refund rose 15% to <a href=\"https://www.nbcrightnow.com/national/average-tax-refunds-by-state-and-county/collection_f257c0aa-6345-5a10-acd4-7957eeedb269.html#5:~:text=Nevada%20had%20an%20average%20refund%20of%20%244%2C193%2C%20with%201.08%20million%20refunds%20issued%20out%20of%201.6%20million%20total%20returns%20%E2%80%94%20an%20overall%20refund%20rate%20of%20roughly%2069.6%25.\">$4,193</a> — among the <a href=\"https://www.nbcrightnow.com/national/average-tax-refunds-by-state-and-county/collection_f257c0aa-6345-5a10-acd4-7957eeedb269.html#5\">highest</a> in the nation.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Investments in Rural Health:</strong> Nevada <a href=\"https://www.gov.nv.gov/press-releases/nevada-announces-first-round-of-grants-under-new-rural-health-transformation-program/#:~:text=Nevada%20was%20awarded%20%24180%20million%20for%20the%20first%20year%20of%20this%20program.%20%C2%A0\">secured</a> nearly $180 million in first-year funding under the Working Families Tax Cuts’ Rural Health Transformation Program.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Protecting Nevada’s Economy: </strong>The Working Families Tax Cuts safeguarded <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/07/president-trumps-working-families-tax-cuts-ignite-manufacturing-renaissance-across-all-50-states/\">$10 billion</a> in state GDP and <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/07/president-trumps-working-families-tax-cuts-ignite-manufacturing-renaissance-across-all-50-states/\">$5 billion</a> in wages for Nevadans.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-safer-communities-and-more-affordable-housing\"><strong>Safer Communities and More Affordable Housing</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Violent crime is <a href=\"https://online.fliphtml5.com/LasVegasMetroPolice/2025-Annual-Report-GfTT/#p=1\">down</a> in <a href=\"https://online.fliphtml5.com/LasVegasMetroPolice/2025-Annual-Report-GfTT/#p=1\">Las Vegas</a> and <a href=\"https://nevadacrimestats.nv.gov/tops/report/violent-crimes/nevada/2025\">statewide</a> compared to the final year of the previous Administration — and is continuing its downward trend.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Trump Administration <a href=\"https://www.cbp.gov/newsroom/national-media-release/trump-administration-delivers-14-straight-months-zero-releases#:~:text=Trump%20administration%20delivers%2014%20straight%20months%20of%20zero%20releases%20at%20the%20border,-Release%20Date&amp;text=WASHINGTON%20%E2%80%94%20Today%2C%20the%20U.S.%20Department,of%20historically%20low%20border%20crossings.\">has not released</a> a single illegal alien into the United States in 14 consecutive months, while the U.S. <a href=\"https://abcnews.com/US/us-1st-time-50-years-experienced-negative-net/story?id=129175522'\">recorded</a> negative net migration in 2025 for the first time in more than five decades and more than three million illegal aliens have left the country since President Trump returned to office.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>As a result, home prices in Las Vegas — one of the <a href=\"https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2019/03/11/us-metro-areas-unauthorized-immigrants/\">top 20</a> metro areas with the largest illegal alien population — have dropped nearly 4% since President Trump took office, the <a href=\"https://www.marketwatch.com/story/las-vegas-home-prices-post-largest-drop-in-the-nation-d39d6ecd/\">largest</a> decline among major U.S. cities. Statewide, home prices are <a href=\"https://www.zillow.com/home-values/42/nv/\">down</a> 2.1% over last year.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-billions-in-new-private-investment\"><strong>Billions in New Private Investment</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Apple <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2025/08/apple-600-billion-commitment-to-boost-u-s-manufacturing/\">announced</a> a $600 billion investment over four years, with Nevada targeted for significant expansion. Amazon <a href=\"https://www.aboutamazon.com/news/job-creation-and-investment/amazon-economic-impact-report-2025\">invested</a> a record $340 billion across the United States in 2025, including customer fulfillment centers and AI and cloud infrastructure projects in Nevada. Vantage Data Centers <a href=\"https://vantage-dc.com/news/vantage-data-centers-invests-3-billion-to-deliver-ai-campus-in-growing-nevada-market/\">announced</a> a $3 billion AI data center campus in Storey County. Crocs <a href=\"https://www.digitalcommerce360.com/2025/08/15/crocs-invest-80-million-las-vegas-fulfillment-center/#:~:text=Crocs%20to%20invest%20%2480%20million%20in%20Las%20Vegas%20fulfillment%20center\">committed</a> $80 million to expand its Las Vegas fulfillment center. First Majestic <a href=\"https://www.firstmajestic.com/investors/news-releases/first-majestic-announces-restart-plan-for-jerritt-canyon-gold-mine\">announced</a> a $75 million investment to restart the Jerritt Canyon Gold Mine in Elko County.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-opening-federal-lands-advancing-energy-dominance\"><strong>Opening Federal Lands, Advancing Energy Dominance</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>The Trump Administration <a href=\"https://www.doi.gov/pressreleases/icymi-secretary-burgum-hud-secretary-turner-announce-joint-task-force-reduce-housing\">launched</a> a joint task force <a href=\"https://www.hud.gov/news/hud-no-25-067\">alongside</a> Gov. Lombardo to open vast tracts of federal land in Nevada for residential development, while <a href=\"https://nevadacurrent.com/2025/06/03/3-nevada-geothermal-projects-fast-tracked-under-trumps-quickie-environmental-review-process/\">fast-tracking</a> several major energy projects to further the American Energy Dominance agenda.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-strengthening-national-defense\"><strong>Strengthening National Defense</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>The FY2027 Air Force budget request <a href=\"https://www.airandspaceforces.com/air-force-doubles-construction-budget-2027-f-47-facilities/#:~:text=%24730%20million%C2%A0for%20new%20hangar%20and%20support%20spaces%20for%20the%C2%A0F%2D47%20fighter.%20The%20facilities%2C%20to%20be%20built%C2%A0at%20Nellis%20Air%20Force%20Base%2C%20Nev.%2C%20anticipate%20the%20F%2D47%E2%80%99s%20first%20flight%20in%202028.\">includes</a> $730 million for new hangars and support facilities at Nellis Air Force Base to host America’s newest sixth-generation fighter jet.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>President Trump and Republicans are delivering results for Nevada families, workers, seniors, and communities — proving once again that America First means Nevada First.</strong></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/08/president-trump-and-republicans-deliver-big-wins-for-the-silver-state/\">President Trump and Republicans Deliver Big Wins for the Silver State</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
